---
/**
 * The /projects headline.
 *
 * No mockup covers this page (Matt, 2026-08-21). It takes the site's hero shape
 * — H1, then a statement beside a bordered right-hand block — with the fill in
 * PROJECTS GREEN, because the spec's rule is that the fill always wears the
 * colour of the section it belongs to.
 *
 * The right-hand block is Matt's GitHub profile, which is a real destination
 * already linked from the footer and /about. Constraint 10 rules out inventing
 * a count or a label to fill the slot, so nothing else goes here.
 *
 * THE HERO'S TYPE AND LAYOUT ARE `.rd-hero` IN global.css: the H1, the 32ch
 * lede, the row, the right block's hairline shell and the 720px collapse.
 */
---

{/*
  A div, not a section — the same call WritingHero.astro made: `npm run
  validate:html` names an h1 inside sectioning content, and an unnamed <section>
  is not exposed as a region anyway.
*/}
<div class="rd-section rd-hero projects-hero" data-module="projects-hero">
  <h1><span class="rd-fill rd-fill--projects">Projects</span></h1>

  <div class="hero-row">
    <p class="hero-statement">
      Software experiments, some built on Temporal and some not. Hobby projects, not a portfolio.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-aside hero-source">
      <span class="hero-source-copy">The source is public.</span>
      <span class="hero-source-links">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/mattpyle"
          class="link-projects"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >github.com/mattpyle<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .projects-hero { padding-top: 78px; }

  .hero-source { gap: 10px; }

  .hero-source-copy {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--ink-5);
  }

  .hero-source-links {
    display: flex;
    column-gap: 20px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono-plex);
    font-size: 19px;
  }

  .link-projects { color: var(--projects); }
  .link-projects:hover { color: var(--projects-hover); }

  .sr-only {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    margin: -1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .projects-hero { padding-top: 40px; }

    /* 44px tap targets, per the mobile spec. */
    .hero-source-links a {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 44px;
      padding: 10px 0;
      font-size: 18px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
  }
</style>
